<body>
    <h1>Meeting Minutes of 2026/6/15</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"1426a627f39a">Hi all,</p>
<p local-id=3D"c71f2a1ae0b0">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2a677c9f9ef9">Thank you so much for your attendance. Please =
kindly check the meeting minutes below for the meeting.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e71191c1a571">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"ce8f8e73ad03">Date: Monday, 15th June, 2026</p>
<p local-id=3D"9d711c9ef8f8">Time: 17:30 HK time</p>
<p local-id=3D"07ecd92601a2">Attendees:Tao Huang, Loura Guo, Jiajin Zhong, =
Daijiang Xie, Yixi Wang, Suijie Song, Guangyuan Mu, Huifang Liu, Jiaxing Da=
i, Shu Cheng</p>
<p local-id=3D"7cff31b47e33">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"232e8497cf4f">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"939cfeb89c99"><strong>Quick Recap</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"981540f28c74">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"11fdb151df4d">This meeting is the sixth weekly meeting of th=
e =E6=B1=87=E4=B8=B0=E7=A7=91=E6=8A=80=E8=8F=81=E8=8B=B1=E8=AE=AD=E7=BB=83=
=E8=90=A5 =E2=80=93 AI=E6=99=BA=E8=83=BD=E9=97=AE=E7=AD=94=E5=8A=A9=E6=89=
=8B.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bd185013e308"></p>
<p local-id=3D"4e39404bc88b">This meeting primarily discussed the progress =
of the Check Home Run project and work updates from each module.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"12598b291749">Tao announced the company visit scheduled for =
the afternoon of July 17th, requiring the team to prepare a 10-minute progr=
ess report presentation, including a PPT display and a mini demo.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"58086f854969">Song Suijie shared basic knowledge about using=
 AI, including the concepts of skills and superpowers, and suggestions for =
using tools like Codex.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"13847f5b5a2e">Module leads demonstrated their progress:&nbsp=
;</p>
<p local-id=3D"054fe7c9fc38">the <strong>web</strong>&nbsp;layer completed =
a simple chat interface demo,&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"af079785719d">the <strong>data processing</strong>&nbsp;laye=
r completed the functionality of converting PDF documents to JSON,&nbsp;</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"2f08d42a3dd7">the<strong>&nbsp;tool layer </strong>defined t=
he unified retrieval interface,&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"75d856907d59">the<strong>&nbsp;agent</strong>&nbsp;layer com=
pleted a mock closed-loop workflow,&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"e81d5e1c543b">the <strong>data persistence</strong>&nbsp;lay=
er provided basic file access interfaces.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"b3332bb68cf5">Wang Yixi emphasized the need to improve team =
communication efficiency and the code submission process, suggesting that m=
odules use <strong>branch management</strong>&nbsp;for development. The mee=
ting concluded with a discussion on the importance of using <strong>Conflue=
nce</strong>&nbsp;as the main documentation platform and the need to improv=
e the format and sharing method of meeting minutes.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b94b5cf7efeb">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"bddc9c8f1003">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"d7dad64996d2"><strong>Discussion Summary</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6249fc763bff">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"ce1f28ad0ed5"><strong>Company Visit Arrangement Discussion</=
strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"bc96914d8bf2">The team discussed the arrangements for the co=
mpany visit on the afternoon of July 17th. The tentative time was confirmed=
 to be fine. Visitors will need to prepare a progress report presentation o=
f about ten minutes, including a background introduction, solution showcase=
, and a mini demo.&nbsp;Wang Yixi confirmed the preparation status of the p=
erformance documents; the basic structure and instructions exist but need f=
urther refinement. Tao emphasized the importance of meeting note formatting=
, requiring everyone to use better formatting methods. Wang Yixi and Song S=
uijie are to discuss and decide which two members will be responsible for t=
he presentation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0c5e31dddf7d">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"6d64eb3a3a02"><strong>AI Tools Sharing</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"83059a5fff43">Song Suijie shared basic knowledge on using AI=
 tools, including the concepts of <strong>skills and superpowers</strong>, =
and recommended using <strong>Codex </strong>instead of the relay station A=
PI. At the end of the sharing, Song Suijie gave a brief demo of the user-fa=
cing web layer, showing the basic functions of the chat interface.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b01c3e418da2">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b6c85e3f7d1"><strong>User Layer Architecture Progress Discu=
ssion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5c45cc3fbee5">Wang Yixi explained that the user layer archit=
ecture includes <strong>a&nbsp;web layer and a simple backend component</st=
rong>, requiring Flask for backend demonstrations. Song Suijie stated that =
the task assignment from the previous week was not clear enough and hoped t=
he team would define more specific requirements this week to improve work e=
fficiency. Song Suijie will continue to improve the user layer by adding th=
e Flask backend part and interfacing with other layers.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e05f83527ca5">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"0416dc9cd3df"><strong>PDF Storage Structure Discussion</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"223045ec1e30">Mu Guangyuan demonstrated the currently comple=
ted work, including the <strong>processing of PDFs and DOCS files</strong>&=
nbsp;and the generation of a <strong>document tree</strong>, but noted that=
 the database and Docker-related tasks were not yet finished. Wang Yixi poi=
nted out that the current file storage method does not conform to the proje=
ct's standard directory structure, suggesting that Mu Guangyuan modify the =
storage path for <strong>processed JSON files</strong>&nbsp;to the project-=
specified <strong>`data/documents` directory.</strong>&nbsp;Wang Yixi also =
showed the project's basic <strong>directory structure </strong>and mention=
ed that the project does not yet have Git branch management set up.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ee975e4bd78">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"8891d2c28a2f"><strong>Unified Retrieval Interface Work Progr=
ess Report</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"bac377a8356e">Dai Jiaxing reported on the progress of the un=
ified retrieval interface, including the <strong>definition of parameters, =
error categories, and three retrieval modes </strong>(vector semantic retri=
eval, keyword retrieval, and hybrid mode). These interfaces are currently c=
allable but return empty content. Dai Jiaxing will continue to improve the =
specific implementations of the three modes. Daijiang Xie introduced the fi=
rst week's completed work for the agent team, including the implementation =
of a <strong>mock closed-loop and a unified response format.</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d8002e3196ac">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"98a914ef0ebf"><strong>Data Persistence Layer Discussion</str=
ong></p>
<p local-id=3D"47705e8c1297">Wang Yixi briefly explained the <strong>interf=
ace specification and usage guide</strong>&nbsp;for the data persistence la=
yer, emphasizing that developers should directly call the provided interfac=
es instead of rewriting the same functionality.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c3d03921815b">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"4baa6ab7591b"><strong>Communication Efficiency and Process O=
ptimization Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d4ac4c64bc21">The team discussed communication efficiency is=
sues. Song Suijie suggested that the classmate responsible for summarizing =
each week's meeting should repeat the <strong>task list</strong>&nbsp;in th=
e group chat and recommended updating important information such as <strong=
>interface documentation&nbsp;to the Confluence platform </strong>first. Wa=
ng Yixi will refine the documentation guidelines on Confluence to ensure me=
mbers from <strong>other groups</strong>&nbsp;can upload files according to=
 the standards. Dai Jiaxing offered suggestions to the web layer for page b=
eautification.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cf53a7228d1f">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"88084f653061"></p>
<p local-id=3D"2d21d9aeded9"><strong>Action Items</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"caee12f8e07f">&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8ce8e62de775">
<li local-id=3D"0e2817c35d3b">
<p local-id=3D"d17edc1c9eb5">All Members: Mark the <strong>afternoon of Jul=
y 17th</strong>&nbsp;as the company visit and project presentation day; pre=
pare in advance.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"ae9d40b30651">
<li local-id=3D"5ae3b56b40a2">
<p local-id=3D"c7cdbd6bd078">All Members: Uniformly <strong>change code com=
ments, commit messages, and frontend UI text to English.</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"8eeda280667f">
<li local-id=3D"f4fb3e18399e">
<p local-id=3D"e9c3e5c64817">All Members: Submit work completed locally las=
t week to respective independent <strong>branches</strong>&nbsp;(create one=
 separate branch per layer).</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"e910ad4319b4">
<li local-id=3D"68a493809476">
<p local-id=3D"2662d9fe42ed">All Members: Determine the work objectives for=
 the second phase <strong>(CPR 2)</strong>&nbsp;within this week and upload=
 them to the <strong>Confluence </strong>platform.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"e428650bf13f">
<li local-id=3D"92e034585aba">
<p local-id=3D"cd4c85673778">All Members: Future <strong>meeting minutes </=
strong>must be organized in a <strong>structured format</strong>&nbsp;(usin=
g headings for sections) for easier reading and use as project data.</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"875b62597b2c">
<li local-id=3D"ed6d44867748">
<p local-id=3D"8acb361a8a22">Tao: Create a group chat including all module =
leads to <strong>coordinate </strong>matters regarding <strong>uploading</s=
trong>&nbsp;performance-related <strong>documents</strong>&nbsp;to <strong>=
Confluence.</strong>&nbsp;Confirm the internal <strong>GitHub remote reposi=
tory</strong>&nbsp;address tomorrow and notify everyone in the group.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"0cd693ae8b6d">
<li local-id=3D"a5d5701376a4">
<p local-id=3D"d02b82e93e8d">Song Suijie: Continue to improve the user laye=
r (web layer) by adding the Flask <strong>backend part </strong>and interfa=
cing with other layers.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"aab821c683df">
<li local-id=3D"245d83b8e3d3">
<p local-id=3D"df6674a7887a">Dai Jiaxing: Improve the specific implementati=
ons of the three modes within the unified <strong>retrieval interface</stro=
ng>: vector retrieval, keyword retrieval, and hybrid retrieval.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"2329ef298eee">
<li local-id=3D"de7f980fb4e7">
<p local-id=3D"55696f4e2450">Wang Yixi: Refine the <strong>documentation gu=
idelines on Confluence</strong>&nbsp;to ensure members from other groups ca=
n upload files according to the standards.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"b08f8c110ac1">
<li local-id=3D"ba6e40f1d3cb">
<p local-id=3D"1eac3dfd0a92">Mu Guangyuan: Modify the storage path for <str=
ong>processed JSON files </strong>to the project-specified `data/documents`=
 directory.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"c6039820d1d9">
<li local-id=3D"5573ac1074ee">
<p local-id=3D"ab071ce77a6c">Wang Yixi / Song Suijie: Discuss and decide wh=
ich <strong>two members</strong>&nbsp;will be responsible for the <strong>p=
resentation on July 17th</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6b7ade8a1b00">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd25ed879a3d"></p>
<p local-id=3D"487cece1ecbc">Hi Huifang and Jiaxing,</p>
<p local-id=3D"916d4be4541b">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"510b33bd1786">Kindly remind you that <strong>Huifang</strong=
>&nbsp;will be the <strong>host</strong>&nbsp;and <strong>Jiajin</strong>&n=
bsp;will be the <strong>MoM Noter</strong>&nbsp;of next weekly meeting. Ple=
ase read above Notes and get prepared.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b6a202d6d7b6">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"11a8b23dfc82">Kind regards,</p>
<p local-id=3D"2c5375068114"></p>
<p local-id=3D"f5e7e0afde67">Huifang Liu</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
